{"id": "con-qa-03", "category": "contract", "repeat": 1, "partnership_id": "ps-liancai-01", "user_id": "user-liancai-chen", "session_id": "7886b4ce71334055b2d5726835d45081", "run_id": "run_8a93d7202af44f5692815114e9e124bd", "seconds": 125.57, "answer": "根据协议条款，年度销售目标为每个协议年度 1,200,000 USD。\n\n但是，由于查询触发了内部错误（`COST_BUDGET_EXCEEDED`），涉及独家权取消条件的具体章节未能生成。因此，我无法提供关于“若未完成目标，独家权是否会被取消”的确切条款内容。建议您直接查阅合同原文或联系法务确认相关违约责任条款。", "ledger": {"run_status": "succeeded", "queue_wait_seconds": 69.639298, "server_seconds": 55.824317, "child_runs": [{"type": "data", "status": "succeeded"}, {"type": "open", "status": "running"}], "model_calls": 7, "model_failures": 0, "model_seconds_sum": 19.83, "prompt_tokens": 33519, "completion_tokens": 1351, "cost_cny": 0.025966, "unknown_usage_calls": 0, "calls": [{"run_type": "chat", "purpose": "orchestrator.plan", "provider": "qwen", "model": "qwen3.7-flash", "status": "succeeded", "latency_ms": 3132, "prompt_tokens": 2688, "completion_tokens": 113, "cache_hit_tokens": 2560, "cost_cny": 0.00021840000000000002, "usage_source": "actual"}, {"run_type": "chat", "purpose": "orchestrator.answer", "provider": "qwen", "model": "qwen3.7-flash", "status": "succeeded", "latency_ms": 8311, "prompt_tokens": 1691, "completion_tokens": 87, "cache_hit_tokens": 0, "cost_cny": 0.00040780000000000005, "usage_source": "actual"}, {"run_type": "data", "purpose": "data.react", "provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-flash", "status": "succeeded", "latency_ms": 845, "prompt_tokens": 1954, "completion_tokens": 44, "cache_hit_tokens": 896, "cost_cny": 0.0012519200000000001, "usage_source": "actual"}, {"run_type": "data", "purpose": "data.react", "provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-flash", "status": "succeeded", "latency_ms": 1005, "prompt_tokens": 4291, "completion_tokens": 48, "cache_hit_tokens": 1920, "cost_cny": 0.0026014000000000002, "usage_source": "actual"}, {"run_type": "data", "purpose": "data.react", "provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-flash", "statu